; DivxDecoder proxy export table.
;
; The four exports stock Wow.exe imports are forwarders. The loader resolves them against
; DivxDecoder_orig.dll before any game code runs, so forwarding can never be null even when the
; white-model detour is disabled or fails.
;
; Name mapping: the original file is renamed to DivxDecoder_orig.dll next to the executable.
EXPORTS
    InitializeDivxDecoder=DivxDecoder_orig.InitializeDivxDecoder
    UnInitializeDivxDecoder=DivxDecoder_orig.UnInitializeDivxDecoder
    DivxDecode=DivxDecoder_orig.DivxDecode
    SetOutputFormat=DivxDecoder_orig.SetOutputFormat
